OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAfter a dry and bright start,
OL,6,Fwith local frost and fog patches,
OL,7,Fcloud will thicken. Showery rain will
OL,8,Fthen spread north and east from late
OL,9,Fmorning, perhaps heavy in places.
OL,10,FLargely mild but breezy.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FCloudy with rain through the
OL,13,Fevening. Becoming drier overnight with
OL,14,Fclear spells, turning cold with a
OL,15,Flocal grass frost. Winds becoming
OL,16,Fstrong, then easing toward dawn.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
