OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CMonday:FA largely dry and bright
OL,6,Fstart, with plenty of sunny spells.
OL,7,FCloud increasing through the
OL,8,Fafternoon. Windy, with outbreaks of
OL,9,Fheavy and persistent rain overnight.
OL,10,FChilly.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FCloudy
OL,13,Fand unsettled, with spells of rain and
OL,14,Fstrong winds at times Tuesday to
OL,15,FThursday. Generally mild, especially
OL,16,Fby night.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
